  "post_content": "<p>La tarde-noche de este viernes se ha inaugurado oficialmente la tienda Superm&oacute;vil, en la avenida Sierra Espad&aacute;n, 48 de Onda. <a href=\".http://www.supermovilstore.com/tienda/\" target=\"_blank\">All&iacute; se puede encontrar lo &uacute;ltimo en telefon&iacute;a y en tecnolog&iacute;a, a trav&eacute;s de un cat&aacute;logo en inernet</a> o en el propio establecimiento. Representan en onda a las compa&ntilde;&iacute;as de tel&eacute;fono de bajo coste M&aacute;sM&oacute;vil y Hits Mobile.</p><div class=\"galeria-ngg\" style=\"display:flex;flex-wrap:wrap;gap:8px;\"><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/supermovilnovembre/img_2039.jpg\" alt=\"img_2039\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/supermovilnovembre/img_2042.jpg\" alt=\"img_2042\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/supermovilnovembre/img_2043.jpg\" alt=\"img_2043\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/supermovilnovembre/img_2044.jpg\" alt=\"img_2044\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/supermovilnovembre/img_2045.jpg\" alt=\"img_2045\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/supermovilnovembre/img_2046.jpg\" alt=\"img_2046\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/supermovilnovembre/img_2047.jpg\" alt=\"img_2047\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/supermovilnovembre/img_2048.jpg\" alt=\"img_2048\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/supermovilnovembre/img_2049.jpg\" alt=\"img_2049\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src